Algorithms
  The raster pipeline reproduces the behaviour of well-known libraries so that output matches the
  original: baseline JPEG decoding follows libjpeg's integer IDCT and fancy upsampling, TIFF fax
  (CCITT) decoding follows libtiff's semantics, and polygon, line, ellipse and resampling
  routines follow Pillow's C implementations (HPND licence). These are reimplementations of the
  documented algorithms, not copies of the libraries.
